<p>Dear <%= @user.try(:username) || @user.try(:email) %>,</p>

<p>Your eSIM for order <strong>#<%= @order.order_number %></strong> is now ready.</p>

<div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">eSIM Details</h3>
  <p><strong>Package:</strong> <%= @esim.esim_order.package_code %></p>
  
  <% if @type == 'inventory' %>
    <p><strong>ICCID:</strong> <%= @esim.iccid %></p>
    <p><strong>Activation Code:</strong> <%= @esim.activation_code %></p>
    <% if @esim.qr_code_url.present? %>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
        <p>Scan this QR Code to install your eSIM:</p>
        <img src="<%= @esim.qr_code_url %>" alt="QR Code" width="200" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
      </div>
    <% end %>
  <% else %>
    <p><strong>ICCID:</strong> <%= @esim.iccid %></p>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
      <p>Please scan the QR code below to install your eSIM:</p>
      <img src="<%= @esim.qr_code_url %>" alt="QR Code" width="200" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>

<p><strong>Installation Guide:</strong></p>
<ol>
  <li>Go to <strong>Settings</strong> > <strong>Cellular</strong> (or Mobile Data) on your device.</li>
  <li>Tap <strong>Add Cellular Plan</strong> (or Add eSIM).</li>
  <li>Scan the QR code provided above.</li>
</ol>

<p>You can also find these details in your dashboard: <a href="<%= ENV['FRONTEND_URL'] %>/dashboard/orders" style="color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none;">View Orders</a></p>

<p>Best Regards,<br>The ProxySock Team</p>
